r spliceosome, involved in the splicing of U12-type introns in pre-mRNAs (PubMed:15146077)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_03","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}